\vspace{0.24cm}

{\fontsize{34}{40}\selectfont\bfseries\color{InkNavy}\kaiti\selectfont 真}\\[0.10cm]
{\fontsize{16}{20}\selectfont\scshape\color{CommentaryBrown} Truth}

\vspace{0.20cm}
{\fontsize{22}{26}\selectfont\bfseries\kaiti\selectfont 約翰二書研讀}\\[0.08cm]
{\fontsize{13}{16}\selectfont\itshape\color{TextGray} A Study of the Second Epistle of John}

\vspace{0.24cm}
{\fontsize{15}{18}\selectfont\itshape\color{InkNavy} ἐν ἀληθείᾳ καὶ ἀγάπῃ}\quad
{\footnotesize\bfseries\color{ThresholdSlate} 在真理和愛心上}

\vfill

\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{white}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.3in}
\centering\vspace{0.15cm}
{\footnotesize\color{InkNavy}\kaiti\selectfont
「我見你的兒女，有照我們從父所受之命令遵行真理的，就甚歡喜。」}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\itshape\color{TextGray}
“I was very glad to find some of your children walking in truth.”}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\color{InkNavy} 約翰二書 1:4 \textperiodcentered\ 2 John 4}
\vspace{0.15cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
\cleardoublepage

%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE — "全書一句話", built on 2 John 9: the dividing line of
%% the whole letter and its promise ("有父又有子").
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{InkNavy} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
凡越過基督的教訓不常守著的，就沒有神；\\
\textbf{\color{LoveCrimson!80!black}常守這教訓的，就有父又有子}。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
Anyone who goes too far and does not abide in the teaching of Christ,\\
does not have God; \textbf{the one who abides in the teaching,}\\
\textbf{he has both the Father and the Son}.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{InkNavy} 約翰二書 1:9 \textperiodcentered\ 2 John 9
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 十三節 \textperiodcentered\ 五步 \textperiodcentered\ 一扇家門\\
\textit{Thirteen verses \textperiodcentered\ five steps \textperiodcentered\ one door}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.6cm}p{1.9cm}p{7.6cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{卷別} & \textbf{經文} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
卷一 \textperiodcentered\ 住 & 1-3節 & 真理先住進來：恩惠、憐憫、平安必常與我們同在 \\
卷二 \textperiodcentered\ 行 & 4-6節 & 真理被活出來：照他的命令行，這就是愛 \\
卷三 \textperiodcentered\ 辨 & 7-9節 & 真理被試驗：耶穌基督是成了肉身來的 \\
卷四 \textperiodcentered\ 守 & 10-11節 & 真理劃出門檻：不要接他到家裏 \\
卷五 \textperiodcentered\ 見 & 12-13節 & 真理的終點：當面談論，喜樂滿足 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{InkNavy} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
這不是一張「如何對付異端」的規條清單，而是一封寫給一個家的信。\\
若你讀完十三節卻只記得「不要接他到家裏」，請從頭再讀；\\
這次留意：門是到第10節才關上的，前面九節都在講真理怎樣住進來、怎樣被愛活出來；\\
而全信的最後一個盼望，是一次面對面的探望。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
This is not a rulebook for handling heretics; it is a letter to a household.\\
If after thirteen verses you remember only "do not receive him into your
house," read it again.\\
This time notice: the door is not shut until verse 10. The nine verses before
it tell how truth comes to live in a home and is walked out in love, and the
letter's last hope is a visit, face to face.}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
\cleardoublepage

